</h1>
<p>A synthetic instruction-tuning dataset designed to teach language models <strong>how to think</strong>, not just what to say. Every example is written to expert standards across 28 categories spanning coding, math, the sciences, the humanities, the arts, finance, medicine, law, business, linguistics, creative writing, roleplay, and narrative prose. Every assistant turn includes a <code>&lt;think&gt;</code> block — genuine deliberation, not a reformatted answer.</p>
